><div class="mt-2 flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><p class="font-secondary text-compact-11 text-white/50 light:text-app-fg-faint">May 20, 10:00 AM</p><button type="button" class="text-compact-10 uppercase tracking-wider hover:text-rose-300 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 text-white/30 light:text-app-fg-faint">Delete chat</button></div></div></div></div></div></div></aside><section class="app-chat-panel flex min-h-chat-viewport flex-1 flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-shell border backdrop-blur-[28px] shadow-shell-panel light:backdrop-blur-none bg-glass-panel-chat border-white/9 light:border-app-border-muted"><header class="app-chat-header border-b px-4 py-5 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 shadow-shell-header bg-glass-header border-white/8 light:border-app-border-subtle"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl"><div class="mb-3 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><p class="font-primary text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/55 light:text-app-fg-tertiary">Employee Assistant</p><span class="inline-flex rounded-full border font-medium app-badge-neutral border-white/20 bg-white/8 text-white/80 light:border-app-border light:bg-app-surface-muted light:text-app-fg-muted px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px]">User mode</span><span class="inline-flex rounded-full border font-medium app-badge-brand border-violet-400/35 bg-violet-500/16 text-violet-200 light:border-amber-300/70 light:bg-amber-50 light:text-amber-950 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px]">Review first</span></div><div class="space-y-2"><h2 class="font-primary text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-app-fg tracking-tight sm:text-[1.9rem]">Plan your time off with confidence</h2><p class="font-secondary text-[15px] leading-7 text-white/70 light:text-app-fg-muted max-w-2xl">Review balances and upcoming requests first, then confirm leave changes safely when you're ready.</p><p class="font-secondary text-xs text-white/55 light:text-app-fg-tertiary block">Start by reviewing your balance or upcoming requests.</p></div></div></header><div class="min-h-0 flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-4 py-6 text-white light:text-app-fg sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-xl flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 py-12"><div class="flex w-full max-w-chat-empty flex-col items-center gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-white/10 p-8 shadow-glass-hero backdrop-blur-[2rem] bg-glass light:border-app-border light:bg-app-surface-muted light:shadow-panel light:backdrop-blur-none border-white/9 light:border-app-border-muted"><div class="flex items-center justify-center"><div role="img" aria-label="Employee Assistant avatar" class="relative shrink-0 select-none overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-cover bg-center h-14 w-14 border border-white/20 shadow-avatar-brand light:border-app-border" style="background-image: url(/chatbot-assistant-avatar.png), var(--avatar-assistant-fallback);"></div></div><div class="text-center"><h2 class="font-primary text-2xl font-bold text-white light:text-app-fg mb-2 text-[1.875rem] leading-[1.3]">Manage your leave</h2><p class="font-secondary text-[15px] leading-7 text-white/70 light:text-app-fg-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">Ask for balances, review upcoming leave, create a new request, or cancel one when your schedule changes.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2.5"></div></div></div></div><div class="border-t border-white/8 backdrop-blur-shell shadow-composer-bar bg-glass-composer light:border-app-border-subtle light:backdrop-blur-none px-4 py-3 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="relative"><form class="flex w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-composer-field px-4 py-2.5 shadow-composer-input backdrop-blur-xl bg-glass-input transition-all duration-200 border border-white/12 bg-white/6 text-white/80 placeholder:text-white/30 hover:border-violet-500/50 light:border-app-border light:bg-app-field light:text-app-fg-muted light:placeholder:text-app-fg-faint light:hover:border-amber-800/35 focus-within:border-violet-400/55 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-violet-400/20 light:focus-within:border-app-border-emphasis light:focus-within:ring-amber-700/25"><textarea placeholder="Ask about your balance, request time off, review approvals, or cancel a request..." aria-label="Chat input" rows="1" class="max-h-composer-textarea flex-1 resize-none overflow-y-auto border-none bg-transparent text-sm leading-composer text-white/90 caret-violet-400/90 outline-none placeholder:text-white/46 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 light:text-app-fg light:caret-app-accent light:placeholder:text-app-fg-faint" style="height: 0px;"></textarea><div class="flex shrink-0 self-end"><button type="submit" disabled="" aria-label="Send" class="grid h-10 w-10 min-h-10 min-w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl transition-all duration-200 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-30 hover:scale-hover-btn hover:shadow-btn-brand bg-btn-disabled text-white/75 light:bg-app-btn-brand-disabled light:text-white/85"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M3.478 2.405a.75.75 0 00-.926.94l2.432 7.905H13.5a.75.75 0 010 1.5H4.984l-2.432 7.905a.75.75 0 00.926.94 60.519 60.519 0 0018.445-8.986.75.75 0 000-1.218A60.517 60.517 0 003.478 2.405z"></path></svg></button></div></form></div><p class="font-secondary text-compact-11 text-white/50 light:text-app-fg-faint px-1 text-center">Helper</p></div></div></section></div></main>"`;

